  "patchNotes": "Season 42 opened September 16, 2026. Masha was reworked and Bruno was revamped in this patch, so older Masha and Bruno assumptions no longer hold. Patch 2.1.90 weakened tank jungle clear, so pro drafts prefer snowball assassin junglers (Hirara, Ling, Fanny, Nolan) over tank junglers and deprioritize tank-first drafting. Against assassin junglers, pro teams draft anti-dive carries (Melissa, Hanabi) and anti-diver EXP laners (Barats). Estes and Floryn force anti-heal drafting.",
